# What a run produces, not what it needs.

# the spec build_family.py writes for the pattern being printed
family_spec.json

# every script here writes its own log beside itself, so it can say what it
# found on a machine where the console is not being watched
*_log.txt

# printed PDFs and the page manifest beside them
smoke/
*.pdf

# the SAC overlays and polar plots. make_charts.py rebuilds these from the
# test reports on N:. The _crop_ pictures in charts/ are NOT generated and
# are committed - see the README.
charts/*_nrc_overlay.png
charts/*_polar_*.png
charts/InLine_*.png
charts/_print_*.jpg

# backups the Rhino scripts write so their _restore companion can undo them.
# They belong to one session on one machine.
*_backup.json

__pycache__/
